    }

    .page {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2937;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
      color: #f9fafb;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0.25rem 0 0.5rem;
    }

    code {
      font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      background: #020617;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.95em;
    }

    pre {
      background: #020617;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
      white-space: pre;
    }

    .tagline {
      color: #9ca3af;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      max-width: 40rem;
    }

    ul {
      margin: 0.3rem 0 0.9rem 1.25rem;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #1d283a;
      color: #93c5fd;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      margin-right: 0.3rem;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #6b7280;
      border-top: 1px solid #1f2937;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 2.3rem;
      }

      .page {
        padding: 3rem 2rem 3.5rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <h1>multiviewcamconnect</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        A multi-view camera connection project with a ready-to-use production build and a modern development
        stack powered by TypeScript and Tailwind CSS.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="pill">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="pill">React</span>
        <span class="pill">Tailwind CSS</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>📂 Directory Structure</h2>
      <pre><code>├── dist/            ⭐ This is the production build (recommended for direct use)
│   ├── index.html   → Open this file in a browser to preview the website
│   ├── assets/      → Bundled CSS, JS, and other resource files
│   └── ...
├── src/             📝 Source code directory (for development and modification)
│   ├── components/  → React components
│   ├── App.jsx      → Main application component
│   ├── index.js     → Entry file
│   └── ...
├── package.json     📦 Project dependency configuration
├── README.md        📖 Project documentation
└── ...</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>🚀 Quick Start</h2>
      <h3>Option 1: Direct Use (Recommended for Beginners)</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Navigate to the <code>dist/</code> directory.</li>
        <li>Double-click the <code>index.html</code> file.</li>
        <li>The website will open in your browser.</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>Option 2: Development Mode (For Users with Coding Experience)</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Make sure Node.js is installed (recommended version: 16+).</li>
        <li>Open a terminal/command line in the project root directory.</li>
        <li>Run: <code>npm install</code></li>
        <li>Run: <code>npm start</code></li>
        <li>The development server will automatically open in your browser.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>💡 Tips</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The <code>dist/</code> directory contains the optimized build and can be directly deployed to a server.</li>
        <li>The root-level <code>index.html</code> is not the final version — always use the one inside <code>dist/</code>.</li>
        <li>To modify the code, edit files inside <code>src/</code> and rebuild the project.</li>
        <li>The project uses a modern tech stack including TypeScript and Tailwind CSS.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>Project: multiviewcamconnect</p>
      <p>Maintainer: Christina Marquez</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
